<p>dar-e Hussain dekhlu bohat udaas hai nazar<br> Najaf se karbalaa hamein bulale arbaeen par<br> labon pay ya hussain hai<br> hamaray dil mein karbalaa hai bibi Fatima (s.a)</p> 
<p>hai jab se qaid me pisar adhoora lag raha hai ghar<br> is intezaar mein hai maa kab aayega mera pasar<br> rihayi ki khabar miley<br> aseer jo bhi be khata hai bibi Fatima (s.a)</p> 
<p>ae sayeda hai aapko Hasan Hussain ki qasam<br> jo khaali godiyan hain ab yeh unn pay kijiye karam<br> ataa ho waarise Azaa<br> labon pay bas yahi dua hai bibi Fatima (s.a)</p> 
<p>mareez lailaaj ko dikhaeye yeh moujeza<br> be haqqe Abide hazeen ataa karen ussay Shifa<br> ae Razia ae Merzia<br> tumharay haath mein Shifa hai bibi Fatima (s.a)</p> 
<p>Bichaunga mai kab talak safe Azaa yahan wahan<br> mujhe woh ghar ataa karen bapaa hon majlise jahan<br> hon ghar mein apke qadam<br> yeh har ghareeb chahta he bibi Fatima (s.a)</p> 
<p>zahoor ho Imam ka banayen aapka haram<br> he maatami ki arzoo bichay wahan bhi farsh-e gham<br> shakista qabar dekhkar<br> hamara dil tadap raha he bibi Fatima (s.a)</p> 
<p>tootay hue dilon ka bas ek aasra hain aap<br> jisko Ali pukaarain wohi Fatima (s.a) hain aap<br> mushkil kusha ke wastay mushkil kusha hain aap<br> zeeshan aur Raza ke labon ki sada hain aap<br> dil hai udaas hum hain pareshan Fatima (s.a)<br> mushkil hamari kijiyej aasaan Fatima (s.a)</p>